      "content": "\"The mercy of letting go.\" That’s an interesting way to frame it. It's as if you're suggesting that there is a certain rationality to it, as opposed to it being some irrational impulse. I've struggled with the idea that choosing to stop is a decision one can actually make with authority, rather than just being something that happens to you.",
